e":"Story","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Heisman of Week 11: Duke's Nate Sheppard has entered the running","description":"In a season in which star running backs seem to be popping up out of nowhere, the Blue Devils' sophomore stands out.","published":"2026-11-17T11:35:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503621/heisman-watch-week-11-duke-nate-sheppard","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on College Football Playoff bubble ahead of committee's third ranking?","description":"A conference-by-conference look at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-17T11:24:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503628/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-third-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Breaking down the major futures for the Big Ten, from the Heisman to the CFP","description":"Let's evaluate whether a standout performance on a three-loss team and a 10-0 team are real or a mirage in the Big Ten.","published":"2026-11-17T13:02:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50504671/college-football-heisman-trophy-cfp-futures-betting-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"Pamela Maldonado","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Arkansas State tells Butch Jones he's out at end of year","description":"Arkansas State has informed football coach Butch Jones that he's out at the end of the season, sources told ESPN's Pete Thamel on Monday night.","published":"2026-11-17T02:45:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50506952/sources-butch-jones-arkansas-state-coach","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-16T23:15:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Illinois may turn to third-string QB Boyd after Houser injury","description":"Illinois might turn to third-string quarterback Carson Boyd this week against No. 15 Iowa after starter Katin Houser suffered a broken nose Friday at UCLA that required surgery.","published":"2026-11-16T21:42:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50504718/illinois-turn-third-string-qb-boyd-houser-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Rivers says NC State only college job he would have taken","description":"New coach Philip Rivers said NC State was the only college job he would have taken.","published":"2026-11-17T12:34:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50504530/rivers-says-nc-state-only-college-job-taken","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"David Hale","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest up to No. 10 in AP poll as top teams avoid upsets","description":"Wake Forest's move up to No. 10 was the only week-over-week change atop the AP poll as the top nine teams remained unchanged.","published":"2026-11-16T20:48:17.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50504044/wake-forest-no-10-ap-poll-top-teams-avoid-upsets","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Texas' Manning to participate in senior day, mum on future","description":"Texas quarterback Arch Manning said Monday he will participate in Saturday's senior day ceremonies despite having one year of eligibility remaining.","published":"2026-11-16T20:31:37.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503997/texas-arch-manning-participate-senior-day","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4899483/sammy-omosigho","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sammy_Omosigho"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Sammy Omosigho","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sammy_Omosigho","description":"American football linebacker (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:24Z","intro":"Samuel Omosigho (born September 17, 2004) is an American football linebacker for the UCLA Bruins. He previously played for the Oklahoma Sooners.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Omosigho attended Crandall High School in Crandall, Texas. Coming out of high school, he was rated as a four-star recruit, where he held offers from Florida, TCU, and Oklahoma. Ultimately, Omosigho committed to play college football for the Oklahoma Sooners."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"In his first collegiate season at the University of Oklahoma in 2023, Omosigho played in 10 games, notching seven tackles with half a tackle for a loss. During the 2024 season, Omosigho played all 13 games, recording 39 tackles with five being for a loss, six pressures, a pass deflection, and a forced fumble.\nHeading into the 2025 season, he was named to the Butkus Award watch list and earned a starting spot at linebacker for the Sooners. In week one of the 2025 season, Omosigho totaled eight tackles and his first career sack in a season opening win over Illinois State. In week 12, he recorded six tackles and a fumble recovery in an upset win over Alabama.\nIn 2026, Omosigho transferred to the University of California, Los Angeles, to play for the Bruins. He was a first-team midseason All-American selection by the Associated Press and was named a semifinalist for the Butkus Award."}]}}